      "side": 1,
      "message": "One edge case that we need to think about is phony --\u003e phony --\u003e actual module. We will also have to do some cleanup before Android.bp checkin and add the top-level phony to `deps` in the generated Android.bp file, instead of each of the real modules.\n\n\nAs an alternative, I have been adding `product:true` or `vendor:true` on the phony targets (e.g. https://r.android.com/3326423)",
