      "writtenOn": "2024-11-04T22:13:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s also cases where actual modules use `required` on a module in a different partition, this issue isn\u0027t exclusive to phonies.\n\nRight now we don\u0027t have a good solution for cross-partition `required`/`overrides` dependencies. I am kindof of the opinion that we should continue doing manual tweaks to checked-in bp files to make these cases simpler rather than attempting something like this.\n\nI think we should discuss this in person tomorrow.",
      "parentUuid": "4ad164bb_23dabed7",
